<title>USA: Summa Four lands switch order from IBM.</title>
<headline>Summa Four lands switch order from IBM.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, N.H. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summa Four said on Tuesday it received a &quot;multi-million-dollar&quot; order from International Business Machines Corp for delivery of VCO open programmble switches.</p>
<p>Summa said the switches will support new voice-processing services. The company declined to disclose the financial terms of the contract.</p>
<p>&quot;IBM has asked us not to get any more specific than the term multi-million,&quot; said John Shaw, Summa's vice president of business development and strategy.</p>
